{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The factory has been silent for years</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something stirs in the shadows. <i>Echoes of Steel</i> is a first-person horror game where your survival depends on <strong>completing rituals</strong>, evading <strong>deadly animatronics</strong>, and <strong>exploring</strong> a decaying labyrinth of steel and concrete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/800432d58024ea515771dba7a12a1100.poster.avif?t=1752779570\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/800432d58024ea515771dba7a12a1100.webm?t=1752779570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The rituals are your only weapon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong> scattered items and <strong>follow ancient rites</strong> to weaken the animatronics and <strong>unlock new areas</strong>. But beware every step brings you closer to danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/a1bb144f29fcc837e2ad4dffe9a935d8.poster.avif?t=1752779570\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/a1bb144f29fcc837e2ad4dffe9a935d8.webm?t=1752779570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The factory is alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the <strong>animatronics numbers grow</strong>, and they become increasingly relentless. These machines can <strong>hear your every move</strong>, forcing you to tread carefully and stay one step ahead or risk being hunted down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/b836dc9ee82e8d55271f46084b8d2d65.poster.avif?t=1752779570\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/b836dc9ee82e8d55271f46084b8d2d65.webm?t=1752779570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the decaying factory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover hidden notes</strong>, and piece together its <strong>dark history</strong>. Every hallway, machine, and chamber tells a story of what happened here and why it was abandoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/59ce9753d42f2b489fca406016a53cb3.poster.avif?t=1752779570\" width=768 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356840/extras/59ce9753d42f2b489fca406016a53cb3.webm?t=1752779570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Deadly Animatronics</strong>: Evade relentless enemies that hunt you down based on sound and movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perform Rituals</strong>: Uncover and complete ancient rituals to progress and unlock new areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Traverse a decaying factory and mine filled with dark secrets and eerie environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Tension</strong>: Face escalating challenges as the number of animatronics grows the longer you take to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Horror</strong>: Experience intense suspense and fear through a first-person perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the factory. Face the animatronics. Wishlist <i>Echoes of Steel</i>  and be the first to escape.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lost But Now Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/0ced3e610cc1e27dd76d4d3e7596dc1fd63931db.jpg"},{"name":"Stealth Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/35cb7e6b2d698eaf5183073792ab1b13ec89880f.jpg"},{"name":"Survive and Escape","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/4841046693e7ba2a1725a9428a5d8e4ae833b4d1.jpg"},{"name":"Out of Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/2c3017196071b84e2961ec7b66199c57ae54026d.jpg"},{"name":"Something Stirs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/fd8fdc3df8d4877a53f8460d848cf63608937874.jpg"},{"name":"A Light in The Abyss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/b585a74865ef410938d04c1ae5c61655dfe63658.jpg"},{"name":"A Spark of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/d65b61f30c79e2a8f1ba223f295e7b597afa0b14.jpg"},{"name":"Silent Predator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/02a4c43b1c127933aea079fe456841ca233f9a79.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient History","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3356840/00742b769f3364c7a73